      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are pleased to present 8 Berkeley Court, a charming two-bedroom mid-terrace property on South Douglas Road, Cork. This home is located in a highly sought-after area known for its residential appeal and excellent connectivity.\r\n\r\nSituated between Cork City and Douglas, the location offers easy access to schools, parks, shopping centres, and public transportation. Berkeley Court is a popular choice for families, young , and retirees due to its modern design, ample space, and proximity to amenities like Douglas Village Shopping Centre and nearby parks.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of Entrance Hallway, Kitchen, Living /Dining Room. Upstairs there are Two Bedrooms and a Family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nFRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the front of the property is a well-maintained lawn creates an attractive first impression. A PVC front door with frosted glass paneling leads into the welcoming entrance hallway.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY 1.73m x 2.78m\r\nThe entrance hallway features timber-effect Lino flooring, one radiator, one centre light and is wired for an alarm system.\r\n\r\nLIVING/DINING ROOM 3.65m x 5.98 m\r\nThe spacious living and dining area features laminate timber-effect flooring, a radiator, and two centre light fittings. A stunning fireplace creates a warm focal point, while glazed double doors provide access to the rear garden and flood the room with natural light. There is also generous under-stairs storage.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN 1.78m x 2.80m\r\nThe kitchen is fitted with tiled flooring and enjoys a window overlooking the front of the property. It comprises built-in kitchen units with contrasting countertops and splash back tiling, a stainless-steel sink with drainer, plumbing for a washing machine, a Rangemaster double oven with a four-ring gas hob and extractor fan overhead, and space for a fridge. A breakfast bar provides additional seating and overlooks the living/dining area.\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING 1.84m x 2.44m\r\nThe stairs and landing are fully carpeted and benefit from a centre light fitting Via the landing there is access to the attic.\r\n\r\nMASTER BEDROOM 3.48m x 3.64m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpeted fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the rear of the property, and built-in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 2.44m x 3.65m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpeted fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the front of the property, and built-in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM 1.86m x 1.72m\r\nThe bathroom is fitted with timber-effect flooring and comprises a heated towel rail, integrated storage units, a three-piece suite including a wash hand basin, WC, and a bath with a Mira Elite electric shower. There is also one Velux window and one centre light.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe Rear of the Property is accessed via glazed double doors from the living/dining area, the rear garden features a patio area and is enclosed by mature hedging and established planting, creating a private and peaceful outdoor area. The space is ideal for outdoor dining, relaxation, and summer entertaining."
      },
